    {
     "t": "p",
     "c": [
      "Is your house beginning to resemble a warehouse and constantly googling “",
      {
       "b": [
        "residential junk removal near me"
       ]
      },
      "”? Here we are. Whether broken equipment takes up valuable space or outdated furniture collects dust, our team of eminent professionals can aid you with all kinds of clutter you can’t get rid of. We operate with such simplified and convenient",
      {
       "b": [
        " residential trash hauling services "
       ]
      },
      "in the Greater Toronto Area that you might wonder why you didn’t give us a call earlier. No matter how massive or minuscule the clutter is, we’ll sweep it up so you can breathe again more effectively in your area. So get in touch with us to bid farewell to the tension and welcome a more hygienic and comfortable house for yourself."
     ]
